11.	The Tamarisk opened his mouth and spoke. 
12.	He addressed the Date Palm: 
13.	@q[Tamarisk,Date Palm]{“My body  
14.	…… the bodies of the gods. 
15.	@noteref{The reference is to statues of tamarisk wood.} You grow your fruits but someone places them  
